// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x0027541E size=114 name=?colorFlash@Drawable@@QAEXPBURGBColor@@III@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=A
void Drawable::colorFlash(const RGBColor *peak, UnsignedInt decayFrames, UnsignedInt attackFrames, UnsignedInt sustainAtPeak)
{
	if (m_colorTintEnvelope == NULL)
		m_colorTintEnvelope = new TintEnvelope;

	if (peak)
	{
		m_colorTintEnvelope->play(peak, attackFrames, decayFrames, sustainAtPeak);
	}
	else
	{
		RGBColor tmp;
		tmp.red = 1.0f;
		tmp.green = 1.0f;
		tmp.blue = 1.0f;
		m_colorTintEnvelope->play(&tmp, 1, 4, 1);
	}

	m_status &= ~4;
}

// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x00275490 size=83 name=?colorTint@Drawable@@QAEXPBURGBColor@@@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=A
void Drawable::colorTint(const RGBColor *peak)
{
	if (peak)
	{
		colorFlash(peak, 0, 0, (UnsignedInt)-2);
		m_status |= 4;
	}
	else
	{
		if (m_colorTintEnvelope == NULL)
			m_colorTintEnvelope = new TintEnvelope;
		m_colorTintEnvelope->rest();
		m_status &= ~4;
	}
}

